    map_miner_reward[miner_id][\"reward_weight\"] += reward[\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/moving_average.py:223:                    \"reward_weight\"\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:5:def get_interval_steps(scoring_interval: int, time_increment: int) -> int:\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:7:    Calculate the number of steps in the given scoring interval based on the time increment.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:9:    return int(scoring_interval / time_increment)\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:12:def calculate_crps_for_miner(\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:16:    scoring_intervals: dict[str, int],\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:19:    Calculate the total CRPS score for a miner's simulations over specified intervals,\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:26:        scoring_intervals (dict): Dictionary of scoring intervals with their names and durations in seconds.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:29:        float: Sum of total CRPS scores over the intervals.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:36:    for interval_name, interval_seconds in scoring_intervals.items():\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:37:        interval_steps = get_interval_steps(interval_seconds, time_increment)\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:38:        absolute_price = interval_name.endswith(\"_abs\")\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:39:        is_gap = interval_name.endswith(\"_gaps\")\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:41:        # If we are considering absolute prices, adjust