             \"Interval\": interval_name,\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:97:                \"CRPS\": total_crps_interval,\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:113:def sum_crps_over_blocks(\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:121:    Sum the CRPS over the observed (non-missing) blocks of a single interval.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:132:        num_intervals = simulated_changes_block.shape[1]\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:140:                for t in range(num_intervals)\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:154:def label_observed_blocks(arr: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:167:def calculate_price_changes_over_intervals(\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:169:    interval_steps: int,\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:174:    Calculate price changes over specified intervals.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:178:        interval_steps (int): Number of steps that make up the interval.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:182:        numpy.ndarray: Array of price changes over intervals.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:184:    # Get the prices at the interval points\nperiodic_screen.parquet\nperiodic_screen_sampled_ranks.json\nrefresh_daily_dense.parquet\nrefresh_daily_dense_template_step12_ranks.json\nrefresh_screen.parquet\nrefresh_training.npz\nstack_interactions.parquet\n                        stackdf:8            1232.038253\n                        stacked              1233.468259\n                        stackperiodic:0.5    1232.417458\n                        stackperiodic:1      1