tual.shape==(17,length//increment+1) and (actual>0).all() and np.isfinite(actual).all()\n    print(asset,'serving/research agreement and future invariance pass',flush=True)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"BTC serving/research agreement and future invariance pass\nHYPE serving/research agreement and future invariance pass\nSP500 serving/research agreement and future invariance pass\nGOOGLX serving/research agreement and future invariance pass\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
