{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_70","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+### Iteration 40 field fidelity\n+\n+The numerical student preserves the teacher's daily gains at 1000 paths. Student CRPS ratios are COM_EQU 0.998859/0.997996 and crypto 0.999453/0.999113, versus teacher 0.998860/0.997989 and 0.999325/0.999171. The student artifact is about 1.7 MiB versus the pretrained cache's 183 MiB, and it does not invoke pretrained inference. Proceed to dense confirmation rather than declare equivalence from a sparse mean alone.\n+\n+## Iteration 41 — daily component interactions (preregistered)\n+\n+- Hypothesis: a tree correction to overall scale and a temporal correction to relative lead shape are complementary; the separate periodic level correction may instead duplicate clock information in the tree.\n+- Change: use the distilled tree, promoted temporal lead and GCD projection. Evaluate every daily development prompt at 1000 paths for the student alone, lead plus projection, and student plus lead plus projection. For COM_EQU only, also test adding the already-screened half-periodic correction to each lead-containing combination. No hourly changes, new fitting labels or final-window inspection.\n+- Result: pending dense official CRPS and reward replay.\n+- Verdict: retain components only if their incremental joint effect survives both regimes. Screen rewards with thinned rounds to avoid replaying clearly inferior combinations, then confirm the selected joint model at every official round before promotion.\n+- Lesson: pending. Individual improvements are not assumed additive.\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/research.py\n@@\n-    stacked_mode = parts[0] in ['stacked','refresh','refresh_old','stacktick','stackdf','stackperiodic','stackensemble','stacktree','stacklead','stackpersist','stackstudent']\n+    stacked_mode = parts[0] in ['stacked','refresh','refresh_old','stacktick','stackdf','stackperiodic','stackensemble','stacktree','stacklead','stackpersist','stackstudent','stackmix']\n@@\n-    temporal_lead_strength = float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='stacklead' else None\n-    tree_strength = float(parts[1]) if parts[0] in ['stacktree','stackstudent'] else None\n-    tree_kind = 'tree_student' if parts[0]=='stackstudent' else 'tree'\n+    temporal_lead_strength = float(parts[2]) if parts[0]=='stackmix' else float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='stacklead' else None\n+    tree_strength = float(parts[1]) if parts[0] in ['stacktree','stackstudent','stackmix'] else None\n+    if tree_strength == 0:\n+        tree_strength = None\n+    tree_kind = 'tree_student' if parts[0] in ['stackstudent','stackmix'] else 'tree'\n@@\n-    periodic_strength=float(parts[1]) if parts[0] in ['periodic','stackperiodic'] else float(parts[2]) if parts[0]=='stacktick' and len(parts)>2 else None\n+    periodic_strength=float(parts[3]) if parts[0]=='stackmix' else float(parts[1]) if parts[0] in ['periodic','stackperiodic'] else float(parts[2]) if parts[0]=='stacktick' and len(parts)>2 else None\n@@\n-    tick_kind=parts[1] if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick'] else 'min'\n-    atom_mode='quantize' if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick'] else parts[0] if parts[0] in ['symboot','hurdle','quantize'] else None\n-    atom_parameter=1. if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick'] else float(parts[1]) if atom_mode else 0.\n+    tick_kind='gcd' if parts[0]=='stackmix' else parts[1] if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick'] else 'min'\n+    atom_mode='quantize' if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick','stackmix'] else parts[0] if parts[0] in ['symboot','hurdle','quantize'] else None\n+    atom_parameter=1. if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick','stackmix'] else float(parts[1]) if atom_mode else 0.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=1 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run agent/research.py --name stack_mix_dense --variants stackstudent:1,stackmix:0: