{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_77","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/report.md\n@@\n ## Experiments\n+\n+The promoted daily lead shape now also receives a bounded linear correction from the frozen temporal encoder's 48 hidden features and the static inputs. It preserves the duration-weighted mean of the original bucket forecast before the existing interpolation/normalization. Chronological selection chooses L2 penalty 0.01; every-prompt CRPS and full reward replay confirm the gain in both development windows. Production reuses the temporal embedding instead of evaluating the encoder twice, and the hourly model is unchanged.\n@@\n | Direct high/low range substitution | Does not transfer consistently; a fixed diffusion-based range calibration is inadequate. |\n+| Frozen temporal lead correction | Improves both daily competitions in full official reward replay; promoted. |\n+| Time-varying Student scale with unchanged one-step marginals | Tiny dev1 gains reverse in dev2; reject finite scale persistence. |\n+| Pretrained-feature shallow trees | Improve daily CRPS but hurt hourly; daily full reward confirmation is pending. |\n+| Numerical teacher distillation | A 1.7 MiB student approximates the 183 MiB pretrained-feature pipeline and preserves initial daily CRPS gains; dense interaction confirmation is pending. |\n@@\n-| dev1 | COM_EQU_24H | 239 / 257 | 129 / 257 | 0.014075 |\n+| dev1 | COM_EQU_24H | 239 / 257 | 129 / 257 | 0.016611 |\n@@\n-| dev1 | CRYPTO_24H | 236 / 257 | 62 / 257 | 0.218222 |\n-| dev2 | COM_EQU_24H | 248 / 257 | 216 / 257 | 0.009365 |\n+| dev1 | CRYPTO_24H | 236 / 257 | 57 / 257 | 0.262694 |\n+| dev2 | COM_EQU_24H | 248 / 257 | 211 / 257 | 0.015254 |\n@@\n-| dev2 | CRYPTO_24H | 257 / 257 | 163 / 257 | 0.126951 |\n+| dev2 | CRYPTO_24H | 257 / 257 | 104 / 257 | 0.166763 |\n@@\n-These correspond to development Score estimates **39.442** and **36.755**, versus 0.32375 and 0.42456 for the starter. It is substantial progress, but not cumulative field leadership. The hourly final-round ranks are 55 and 1, distinct from cumulative ranks 25 and 9. Commodity/equity emissions remain particularly weak. Each row uses all official reward rounds for its selected candidate; hourly has 1,624/1,847 post-warmup rounds, daily crypto 1,015/1,044, and COM_EQU 1,499/1,474. Production and research paths match to relative tolerance 1e-12 on representative assets and both formats. The reserved final validation remains untouched.\n+These correspond to development Score estimates **41.009** and **38.279**, versus 0.32375 and 0.42456 for the starter. It is substantial progress, but not cumulative field leadership. The hourly final-round ranks are 55 and 1, distinct from cumulative ranks 25 and 9. Commodity/equity emissions remain particularly weak. Each row uses all official reward rounds for its selected candidate; hourly has 1,624/1,847 post-warmup rounds, daily crypto 1,015/1,044, and COM_EQU 1,499/1,474. Production and research paths match to relative tolerance 1e-12 on representative assets and both formats. The reserved final validation remains untouched.\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+### Iteration 34 full reward result\n+\n+The independent daily refinements pass full replay. GCD projection improves reward ratios from 0.218222/0.126951 to 0.226401/0.133456 for crypto, and from 0.014075/0.009365 to 0.014211/0.009528 for COM_EQU. Adding half-periodic correction with projection reaches COM_EQU 0.024937/0.011444, ranks 126/214 of 257. These controls predate the newly promoted temporal lead correction; retain them for the explicitly preregistered joint experiment rather than assume their gains add to the new model.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\ngit diff --check; git add .gitignore agent/modeling.py agent/research.py agent/tree_vol.py agent/fit_tree_student.py agent/tree_student_weights.npz agent/tree_student_weights.json agent/newton_score.py agent/fit_newton_score.py agent/journal.md agent/report.md agent/results/student_screen.parquet agent/results/persistence_screen.parquet agent/results/lead_temporal_dense_comparison_template_step1_ranks.json agent/results/stack_daily_dense_template_step1_ranks.json; git commit -m \\\"Promote confirmed temporal lead correction and investigate distilled daily scale\\\"\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
