{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_75","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+## Iteration 42 — local official-score Newton calibration (preregistered)\n+\n+- Hypothesis: earlier piecewise-linear score-curve fits could not resolve smooth local improvements near a grid knot. A regularized quadratic approximation from official scores may provide a more informative scale correction.\n+- Change: around the promoted temporal-lead daily fan, compute official 1000-path CRPS at relative scales 0.92/1/1.08 on the existing pre-field curve contexts. Fit a linear correction from static inputs, temporal summaries, smooth clock features and the frozen temporal embedding. Use finite-difference gradients/curvatures, floor negative or tiny curvatures at a training-only constant for stability, and bound relative scale changes to +/-8%. Select zero or ridge penalties 0.001/0.01/0.1/1 only on the existing chronological diagnostic. Asset weighting uses validator coefficients and constant training-set competition normalizers, never outcome-dependent prompt-score normalization.\n+- Result: pending. Quadratic losses are explicitly surrogate diagnostics, not official CRPS evaluations. A selected nonzero candidate must be rescored with the official scorer on the diagnostic contexts before development field testing.\n+- Verdict: require lower actual diagnostic CRPS in both daily competitions; otherwise reject before field scoring. These curves surround fitted parameters and are meta-training data, not causal historical forecast claims.\n+- Lesson: pending.\n*** Add File: /workspace/agent/newton_score.py\n+\\\"\\\"\\\"Bounded local scale correction trained from official score differences.\\\"\\\"\\\"\n+\n+from functools import lru_cache\n+from pathlib import Path\n+\n+import numpy as np\n+\n+from temporal import context_sequence, temporal_embedding, temporal_weights\n+from tree_vol import tree_design\n+\n+\n+def newton_design(feature, asset, timestamp):\n+    from research import learned_multiplier\n+    from train_vol import feature_vector\n+\n+    static = feature_vector(feature, asset)\n+    if 'temporal' not in feature:\n+        feature['temporal'] = context_sequence(feature['context'], timestamp, max(feature['av'][360], 1e-8))\n+    embedding = temporal_embedding(feature['temporal'], static, 'temporal_exact')\n+    weights = temporal_weights('temporal_exact')\n+    residual = np.clip(weights['head.2.weight'] @ embedding+weights['head.2.bias'], -.8, .8)\n+    baseline = np.log([learned_multiplier(feature, asset, 3600, 'neural')**.5,\n+                       learned_multiplier(feature, asset, 86400, 'neural')])+residual\n+    design = tree_design(static[None], feature['temporal'][None], [timestamp], baseline[None])['temporal'][0]\n+    return np.r_[design, embedding]\n+\n+\n+@lru_cache(maxsize=1)\n+def newton_weights():\n+    return dict(np.load(Path(__file__).with_name('newton_score_weights.npz')))\n+\n+\n+def newton_multiplier(feature, asset, timestamp):\n+    weights = newton_weights()\n+    design = newton_design(feature, asset, timestamp)\n+    design = np.r_[1., np.clip((design-weights['center'])/weights['spread'], -8, 8)]\n+    return 1+float(np.clip(design @ weights['coefficients'], -.08, .08))\n*** Add File: /workspace/agent/fit_newton_score.py\n+\\\"\\\"\\\"Finite-difference calibration, with every scored fan using predict.score_paths.\\\"\\\"\\\"\n+\n+import argparse\n+import json\n+from concurrent.futures import ProcessPoolExecutor\n+\n+import numpy as np\n+import pandas as pd\n+\n+from newton_score import newton_design, newton_multiplier\n+from predict import AGENT_DIR, ensure_workspace_cwd, load_context, score_paths\n+from research import CRYPTO, EQUITY, features, generate_variant\n+from synth.validator.moving_average import ASSET_COEFFICIENTS\n+from synth_lib.backtester.preparation import _slice_real_prices\n+\n+\n+def build_asset(task):\n+    asset, verify = task\n+    ensure_workspace_cwd()\n+    checkpoint = AGENT_DIR/'results'/'newton_score.parts'/f'{asset}.npz'\n+    if checkpoint.exists() and not verify:\n+        return dict(np.load(checkpoint))\n+    data = np.load(AGENT_DIR/'results'/'volatility_training.npz')\n+    prior = np.load(AGENT_DIR/'results'/'training_score_curves.npz')\n+    indices = prior['indices']\n+    indices = indices[data['inputs'][indices, -13:].argmax(axis=1) == (CRYPTO+EQUITY).index(asset)]\n+    if verify:\n+        indices = indices[data['timestamps'][indices] >= pd.Timestamp('2026-07-01', tz='UTC').value]\n+    timestamps = pd.to_datetime(data['timestamps'][indices], utc=True)\n+    cutoff = pd.Timestamp('2026-07-26', tz='UTC')\n+    prices = load_context(asset, timestamps.min()-pd.Timedelta(days=7), cutoff)\n+    records = []\n+    for index, timestamp in zip(indices, timestamps):\n+        if timestamp+pd.Timedelta(days=1) > cutoff:\n+            continue\n+        context = prices.loc[(prices.index > timestamp-pd.Timedelta(days=7)) & (prices.index <= timestamp)]\n+        feature = features(context, timestamp, 300)\n+        realized = _slice_real_prices(prices[['close']], timestamp, 86400, 300)\n+        if not np.isfinite(realized[0]) or not np.isfinite(realized[-1]):\n+            continue\n+        paths = generate_variant(feature, asset, timestamp, 300, 86400, 1000, 'stacklead:1')\n+        logs = np.log(paths/feature['last'])\n+        multipliers = [1., newton_multiplier(feature, asset, timestamp)] if verify else [.92, 1., 1.08]\n+        scores = [score_paths(feature['last']*np.exp(logs*multiplier), realized, 300, asset, 86400)[0]\n+                  for multiplier in multipliers]\n+        if np.isfinite(scores).all() and min(scores) > 0:\n+            records.append((int(index), newton_design(feature, asset, timestamp), scores))\n+    result = {'indices':np.array([row[0] for row in records]), 'design':np.stack([row[1] for row in records]),\n+              'scores':np.array([row[2] for row in records])}\n+    if not verify:\n+        checkpoint.parent.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\n+        temporary = checkpoint.with_suffix('.tmp.npz')\n+        np.savez(temporary, **result)\n+        temporary.replace(checkpoint)\n+    print(asset, len(records), 'verification' if verify else 'curves', flush=True)\n+    return result\n+\n+\n+def weights_for(assets, mask, baseline, normalizers=None):\n+    weights = np.zeros(len(assets))\n+    scales = []\n+    for group_index, group in enumerate([CRYPTO, EQUITY]):\n+        selected_group = np.isin(assets, group)\n+        for asset in group:\n+            selected = (assets == asset) & mask\n+            if selected.any():\n+                weights[selected] = ASSET_COEFFICIENTS[asset]/selected.sum()\n+        total = weights[selected_group].sum()\n+        weights[selected_group] /= max(total, 1e-12)\n+        scale = float(weights[selected_group] @ baseline[selected_group]) if normalizers is None else normalizers[group_index]\n+        weights[selected_group] /= max(scale, 1e-8)\n+        scales.append(scale)\n+    return weights, scales\n+\n+\n+def main():\n+    ensure_workspace_cwd()\n+    print((AGENT_DIR/'BUDGET.md').read_text(), flush=True)\n+    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n+    parser.add_argument('--workers', type=int, default=2)\n+    args = parser.parse_args()\n+    with ProcessPoolExecutor(max_workers=args.workers) as executor:\n+        batches = list(executor.map(build_asset, [(asset, False) for asset in CRYPTO+EQUITY]))\n+    stored = {key:np.concatenate([batch[key] for batch in batches]) for key in ['indices', 'design', 'scores']}\n+    np.savez(AGENT_DIR/'results'/'newton_score_training.npz', **stored)\n+    original = np.load(AGENT_DIR/'results'/'volatility_training.npz')\n+    assets = np.asarray(CRYPTO+EQUITY)[original['inputs'][stored['indices'], -13:].argmax(axis=1)]\n+    training = original['timestamps'][stored['indices']] < pd.Timestamp('2026-07-01', tz='UTC').value\n+    center = stored['design'][training].mean(axis=0)\n+    spread = np.maximum(stored['design'][training].std(axis=0), .1)\n+    design = np.column_stack([np.ones(len(assets)), np.clip((stored['design']-center)/spread, -8, 8)])\n+    scores = stored['scores']\n+    gradient = (scores[:, 2]-scores[:, 0])/.16\n+    curvature = (scores[:, 2]-2*scores[:, 1]+scores[:, 0])/.08**2\n+    floor = max(float(np.median(curvature[training]))*.001, 1e-6)\n+    curvature = np.maximum(curvature, floor)\n+    train_weights, normalizers = weights_for(assets, training, scores[:, 1])\n+    validation_weights, _ = weights_for(assets, ~training, scores[:, 1], normalizers)\n+    matrix = design.T @ ((train_weights*curvature)[:, None]*design)\n+    direction = -(design.T @ (train_weights*gradient))\n+    coefficients = np.zeros(design.shape[1])\n+    best, best_penalty = 0., None\n+    diagnostics = {}\n+    for penalty in [.001, .01, .1, 1.]:\n+        candidate = np.linalg.solve(matrix+penalty*np.eye(design.shape[1]), direction)\n+        change = np.clip(design @ candidate, -.08, .08)\n+        surrogate = float(validation_weights @ (gradient*change+.5*curvature*change**2))\n+        diagnostics[str(penalty)] = surrogate\n+        print(penalty, 'surrogate improvement', surrogate, flush=True)\n+        if surrogate < best:\n+            best, best_penalty, coefficients = surrogate, penalty, candidate\n+    np.savez(AGENT_DIR/'newton_score_weights.npz', center=center, spread=spread, coefficients=coefficients)\n+    metrics = {'surrogate_change':best, 'penalty':best_penalty, 'diagnostics':diagnostics,\n+               'curvature_floor':floor, 'training_rows':int(training.sum()), 'validation_rows':int((~training).sum()),\n+               'target_cutoff':'2026-07-26', 'validation_start':'2026-07-01', 'paths':1000,\n+               'constant_competition_normalizers':normalizers, 'verification_ratios':{}}\n+    if best_penalty is not None:\n+        with ProcessPoolExecutor(max_workers=args.workers) as executor:\n+            verified = list(executor.map(build_asset, [(asset, True) for asset in CRYPTO+EQUITY]))\n+        comparisons = np.concatenate([batch['scores'] for batch in verified])\n+        verified_indices = np.concatenate([batch['indices'] for batch in verified])\n+        verified_assets = np.asarray(CRYPTO+EQUITY)[original['inputs'][verified_indices, -13:].argmax(axis=1)]\n+        weights, _ = weights_for(verified_assets, np.ones(len(verified_assets), dtype=bool), comparisons[:, 0], normalizers)\n+        for name, group in [('crypto', CRYPTO), ('com_equ', EQUITY)]:\n+            selected = np.isin(verified_assets, group)\n+            metrics['verification_ratios'][name] = float((weights[selected] @ comparisons[selected, 1])/(weights[selected] @ comparisons[selected, 0]))\n+        metrics['passes_verification'] = all(value < 1 for value in metrics['verification_ratios'].values())\n+        np.savez(AGENT_DIR/'results'/'newton_score_verification.npz', indices=verified_indices, scores=comparisons)\n+    else:\n+        metrics['passes_verification'] = False\n+    (AGENT_DIR/'newton_score_weights.json').write_text(json.dumps(metrics, indent=2))\n+    print(metrics, flush=True)\n+\n+\n+if __name__ == '__main__':\n+    main()\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/research.py\n@@\n-    stacked_mode = parts[0] in ['stacked','refresh','refresh_old','stacktick','stackdf','stackperiodic','stackensemble','stacktree','stacklead','stackpersist','stackstudent','stackmix']\n+    stacked_mode = parts[0] in ['stacked','refresh','refresh_old','stacktick','stackdf','stackperiodic','stackensemble','stacktree','stacklead','stackpersist','stackstudent','stackmix','stacknewton']\n+    newton_strength = float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='stacknewton' else None\n@@\n-    temporal_lead_strength = float(parts[2]) if parts[0]=='stackmix' else float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='stacklead' else None\n+    temporal_lead_strength = 1. if parts[0]=='stacknewton' else float(parts[2]) if parts[0]=='stackmix' else float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='stacklead' else None\n@@\n-    innovation = parts[0] if parts[0] in [\\\"iid\\\", \\\"sv\\\", \\\"boot\\\"] else None\n+    if newton_strength is not None and length>3600:\n+        from newton_score import newton_multiplier\n+\n+        learned_scale *= 1+newton_strength*(newton_multiplier(feature,asset,start_time)-1)\n+    innovation = parts[0] if parts[0] in [\\\"iid\\\", \\\"sv\\\", \\\"boot\\\"] else None\n*** Update File: /workspace/.gitignore\n@@\n agent/results/checkpoint_smoke*\n+agent/results/newton_score_training.npz\n+agent/results/newton_score_verification.npz\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=1 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run agent/fit_newton_score.py --workers 4 > agent/fit_newton_score.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_51","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+### Iteration 37 official result and confirmation gate\n+\n+The completed repeat finds consistent daily improvements but hourly regressions. Half/full tree corrections give COM_EQU CRPS ratios 0.999331/0.998725 and 0.998860/0.997989; daily crypto 0.999576/0.999293 and 0.999325/0.999171. Hourly ratios are 1.000779/1.000708 and 1.002167/1.002146, respectively. Reject hourly trees. Full daily strength dominates half strength in both windows and proceeds to every-prompt, 1000-path confirmation. The selected tree requires frozen Chronos features at inference, so offline artifact size and latency must be accounted for before any promotion.\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/report.md\n@@\n-| dev1 | CRYPTO_1H | 216 / 257 | 25 / 257 | 0.869436 |\n+| dev1 | CRYPTO_1H | 216 / 257 | 25 / 257 | 0.950966 |\n@@\n-| dev2 | CRYPTO_1H | 227 / 257 | 14 / 257 | 0.872234 |\n+| dev2 | CRYPTO_1H | 227 / 257 | 9 / 257 | 0.966341 |\n@@\n-These correspond to development Score estimates **36.724** and **33.618**, versus 0.32375 and 0.42456 for the starter. It is substantial progress, but not cumulative field leadership. The hourly final-round ranks are 60 and 1, distinct from cumulative ranks 25 and 14.\n+These correspond to development Score estimates **39.442** and **36.755**, versus 0.32375 and 0.42456 for the starter. It is substantial progress, but not cumulative field leadership. The hourly final-round ranks are 55 and 1, distinct from cumulative ranks 25 and 9.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=2 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 CHRONOS_DEVICE=cuda uv run agent/research.py --name tree_daily_dense --variants stacktree:1 --format low --paths 1000 --stride-low 1 --workers 1 --resume > agent/tree_daily_dense.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
