{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_94","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+### Iterations 42–43 rejection\n+\n+Reject Newton calibration after the preregistered development check: relative to temporal lead, daily CRPS ratios are COM_EQU 0.998421/1.000013 and crypto 1.000146/1.002063. The small actual pre-field diagnostic improvement does not transfer consistently. Do not rescue it by choosing another penalty from field outcomes.\n+\n+Reject the quote-activity extension before field scoring. The best activity likelihood is 1.007615 versus 1.007667 for the same model without activity: improvement 0.000053, below the preregistered 0.0001 attribution threshold. Both improve the uncorrected 1.008593 diagnostic, so most of the apparent gain comes from another residual tree rather than the added activity features.\n+\n+## Iteration 44 — nonlinear temporal lead-shape fine-tuning (preregistered)\n+\n+- Hypothesis: the frozen linear lead residual may leave useful sequence information inaccessible; a small nonlinear shape-specific encoder can improve the relative early/late volatility profile without changing its mean level.\n+- Change: initialize a separate copy of the existing temporal convolutional encoder and 48-unit hidden layer, with a zero-initialized five-bucket output. Fit a bounded +/-0.5 log-shape residual around the promoted static-plus-linear lead forecast, preserving its duration-weighted mean. Use seed 73, AdamW learning rate 0.0002, weight decay 0.1, 120 epochs, batch size 512, residual penalty 0.05 and adjacent-residual penalty 0.02. Select the best existing chronological diagnostic epoch, including identity at epoch -1. If nonzero wins, test half/full strengths around the selected daily joint stack, keeping its student, periodic and lattice components fixed.\n+- Result: pending. This is the only GPU job; GPU allocation is capped at 35%.\n+- Verdict: require both-window official gains and full rewards before promotion. Do not add seeds or extend epochs after a failed field result.\n+- Lesson: pending.\n*** Add File: /workspace/agent/fit_lead_finetune.py\n+\\\"\\\"\\\"Fit a mean-preserving nonlinear temporal lead correction.\\\"\\\"\\\"\n+\n+import json\n+\n+import numpy as np\n+import pandas as pd\n+import torch\n+from torch import nn\n+\n+from predict import AGENT_DIR, ensure_workspace_cwd\n+from temporal import temporal_embedding\n+from train_temporal import TemporalNetwork\n+\n+\n+def main():\n+    ensure_workspace_cwd()\n+    print((AGENT_DIR/'BUDGET.md').read_text(), flush=True)\n+    torch.set_num_threads(2)\n+    torch.manual_seed(73)\n+    device = 'cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu'\n+    if device == 'cuda':\n+        torch.cuda.set_per_process_memory_fraction(.35)\n+    data = np.load(AGENT_DIR/'results'/'volatility_training.npz')\n+    sequences = np.load(AGENT_DIR/'results'/'temporal_exact_training.npz')\n+    leads = np.load(AGENT_DIR/'results'/'lead_training.npz')\n+    selected = sequences['indices']\n+    inputs = data['inputs'][selected]\n+    keys = pd.MultiIndex.from_arrays([data['timestamps'][selected], inputs[:, -13:].argmax(axis=1)])\n+    lead_keys = pd.MultiIndex.from_arrays([leads['timestamps'], leads['inputs'][:, -13:].argmax(axis=1)])\n+    positions = lead_keys.get_indexer(keys)\n+    valid = positions >= 0\n+    inputs = inputs[valid]\n+    targets = np.clip(leads['targets'][positions[valid]], .02, 20)\n+    weights = dict(np.load(AGENT_DIR/'lead_weights.npz'))\n+    static = np.clip((inputs-weights['center'])/weights['spread'], -8, 8)\n+    hidden = static.copy()\n+    for layer in [0, 2]:\n+        hidden = hidden @ weights[f'{layer}.weight'].T+weights[f'{layer}.bias']\n+        hidden = hidden/(1+np.exp(-hidden))\n+    baseline = np.clip(hidden @ weights['4.weight'].T+weights['4.bias'], -2, 2)\n+    embedded = np.stack([temporal_embedding(sequence, values, 'temporal_exact')\n+                         for sequence, values in zip(sequences['sequences'][valid], inputs)])\n+    linear = dict(np.load(AGENT_DIR/'lead_temporal_weights.npz'))\n+    design = np.column_stack([embedded, static])\n+    design = np.column_stack([np.ones(len(design)), np.clip((design-linear['center'])/linear['spread'], -8, 8)])\n+    raw = baseline+np.clip(design @ linear['coefficients'], -.5, .5)\n+    duration = np.diff(weights['edges'])/weights['edges'][-1]\n+    baseline = raw-np.log((np.exp(raw)*duration).sum(axis=1)/(np.exp(baseline)*duration).sum(axis=1))[:, None]\n+    training = data['timestamps'][selected][valid] < pd.Timestamp('2026-07-01', tz='UTC').value\n+    network = TemporalNetwork()\n+    network.head[2] = nn.Linear(48, 5)\n+    previous = dict(np.load(AGENT_DIR/'temporal_exact_weights.npz'))\n+    network.load_state_dict({key:torch.tensor(previous[key]) for key in network.state_dict() if not key.startswith('head.2')}, strict=False)\n+    nn.init.zeros_(network.head[2].weight)\n+    nn.init.zeros_(network.head[2].bias)\n+    network = network.to(device)\n+    sequence_tensor = torch.tensor(sequences['sequences'][valid], dtype=torch.float32, device=device)\n+    static_tensor = torch.tensor(static, dtype=torch.float32, device=device)\n+    labels = torch.tensor(targets, dtype=torch.float32, device=device)\n+    baseline_tensor = torch.tensor(baseline, dtype=torch.float32, device=device)\n+    duration_tensor = torch.tensor(duration, dtype=torch.float32, device=device)\n+    indices = torch.tensor(np.flatnonzero(training), device=device)\n+    validation = torch.tensor(np.flatnonzero(~training), device=device)\n+    optimizer = torch.optim.AdamW(network.parameters(), lr=.0002, weight_decay=.1)\n+\n+    def loss_for(batch, regularize=False):\n+        correction = network(sequence_tensor[batch], static_tensor[batch]).clamp(-.5, .5)\n+        raw = baseline_tensor[batch]+correction\n+        normalization = torch.log((raw.exp()*duration_tensor).sum(axis=1)/(baseline_tensor[batch].exp()*duration_tensor).sum(axis=1))\n+        prediction = raw-normalization[:, None]\n+        loss = ((labels[batch]*torch.exp(-prediction)+prediction)*duration_tensor).sum(axis=1).mean()\n+        if regularize:\n+            loss = loss+.05*correction.square().mean()+.02*torch.diff(correction, dim=1).square().mean()\n+        return loss\n+\n+    initial = best = float(loss_for(validation).detach().cpu())\n+    best_epoch = -1\n+    best_state = {key:value.detach().cpu().numpy().copy() for key, value in network.state_dict().items()}\n+    for epoch in range(120):\n+        for batch in indices[torch.randperm(len(indices), device=device)].split(512):\n+            optimizer.zero_grad()\n+            loss_for(batch, True).backward()\n+            optimizer.step()\n+        with torch.no_grad():\n+            loss = float(loss_for(validation).cpu())\n+        if loss < best:\n+            best, best_epoch = loss, epoch\n+            best_state = {key:value.detach().cpu().numpy().copy() for key, value in network.state_dict().items()}\n+        if epoch % 20 == 0:\n+            print(epoch, loss, best, flush=True)\n+    np.savez(AGENT_DIR/'lead_finetune_weights.npz', center=weights['center'], spread=weights['spread'], duration=duration, **best_state)\n+    metrics = {'initial_validation_loss':initial, 'best_validation_loss':best, 'best_epoch':best_epoch,\n+               'training_rows':int(training.sum()), 'validation_rows':int((~training).sum()),\n+               'target_cutoff':'2026-07-26', 'validation_start':'2026-07-01', 'seed':73, 'epochs':120}\n+    (AGENT_DIR/'lead_finetune_weights.json').write_text(json.dumps(metrics, indent=2))\n+    print(metrics, flush=True)\n+\n+\n+if __name__ == '__main__':\n+    main()\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/research.py\n@@\n-    stacked_mode = parts[0] in ['stacked','refresh','refresh_old','stacktick','stackdf','stackperiodic','stackensemble','stacktree','stacklead','stackpersist','stackstudent','stackmix','stacknewton']\n+    stacked_mode = parts[0] in ['stacked','refresh','refresh_old','stacktick','stackdf','stackperiodic','stackensemble','stacktree','stacklead','stackpersist','stackstudent','stackmix','stacknewton','stackfine']\n+    fine_strength = float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='stackfine' else None\n@@\n-    temporal_lead_strength = 1. if parts[0]=='stacknewton' else float(parts[2]) if parts[0]=='stackmix' else float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='stacklead' else None\n-    tree_strength = float(parts[1]) if parts[0] in ['stacktree','stackstudent','stackmix'] else None\n+    temporal_lead_strength = 1. if parts[0] in ['stacknewton','stackfine'] else float(parts[2]) if parts[0]=='stackmix' else float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='stacklead' else None\n+    tree_strength = 1. if parts[0]=='stackfine' else float(parts[1]) if parts[0] in ['stacktree','stackstudent','stackmix'] else None\n@@\n-    tree_kind = 'tree_student' if parts[0] in ['stackstudent','stackmix'] else 'tree'\n+    tree_kind = 'tree_student' if parts[0] in ['stackstudent','stackmix','stackfine'] else 'tree'\n@@\n-    periodic_strength=float(parts[3]) if parts[0]=='stackmix' else float(parts[1]) if parts[0] in ['periodic','stackperiodic'] else float(parts[2]) if parts[0]=='stacktick' and len(parts)>2 else None\n+    periodic_strength=(0. if asset in CRYPTO else .5) if parts[0]=='stackfine' else float(parts[3]) if parts[0]=='stackmix' else float(parts[1]) if parts[0] in ['periodic','stackperiodic'] else float(parts[2]) if parts[0]=='stacktick' and len(parts)>2 else None\n@@\n-    tick_kind='gcd' if parts[0]=='stackmix' else parts[1] if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick'] else 'min'\n-    atom_mode='quantize' if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick','stackmix'] else parts[0] if parts[0] in ['symboot','hurdle','quantize'] else None\n-    atom_parameter=1. if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick','stackmix'] else float(parts[1]) if atom_mode else 0.\n+    tick_kind='gcd' if parts[0] in ['stackmix','stackfine'] else parts[1] if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick'] else 'min'\n+    atom_mode='quantize' if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick','stackmix','stackfine'] else parts[0] if parts[0] in ['symboot','hurdle','quantize'] else None\n+    atom_parameter=1. if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick','stackmix','stackfine'] else float(parts[1]) if atom_mode else 0.\n@@\n             bucket_scale = corrected_buckets(feature['temporal'], feature_vector(feature,asset), bucket_scale, temporal_lead_strength)\n+        if fine_strength is not None:\n+            from temporal import temporal_residual, temporal_weights\n+\n+            correction = np.clip(temporal_residual(feature['temporal'],feature_vector(feature,asset),'lead_finetune'),-.5,.5)\n+            adjusted = bucket_scale*np.exp(fine_strength*correction)\n+            duration = temporal_weights('lead_finetune')['duration']\n+            bucket_scale = adjusted*(bucket_scale @ duration)/(adjusted @ duration)\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=2 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run agent/fit_lead_finetune.py > agent/fit_lead_finetune.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
