ches **0.395023/0.241880**, with cumulative ranks **33/86 of 257** and final-round ranks 81/45. Both improve the promoted temporal-lead model in both windows. Promote the numerical student, daily GCD projection, and half-periodic COM_EQU correction together with the already confirmed temporal lead. Production evaluates only the student's daily tree head, reuses temporal inputs/embedding, and needs no Chronos, Torch or sklearn inference. Hourly remains unchanged. Combined with the hourly incumbent, development Score estimates are about 46.468/41.063; these are not held-out or post-cutoff scores.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nimport sys,time\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nsys.path.insert(0,'agent')\nfrom modeling import simulate\nfrom predict import load_context\nfrom research import features,generate_variant\nstamp=pd.Timestamp('2026-08-11 12:00',tz='UTC')\nfor asset in ['BTC','HYPE','SP500','GOOGLX']:\n    context=load_context(asset,stamp-pd.Timedelta(days=7),stamp)\n    context=context.loc[context.index>stamp-pd.Timedelta(days=7)]\n    for length,increment in [(86400,300),(3600,60)]:\n        variant=('stackmix:1:1:0' if asset in ['BTC','HYPE'] else 'stackmix:1:1:0.5') if length==86400 else 'stacktick:gcd'\n        feature=features(context,stamp,increment)\n        for count in [17,1000]:\n            expected=generate_variant(feature,asset,stamp,increment,length,count,variant)\n            started=time.perf_counter()\n            actual=np.array(simulate(asset,stamp,increment,length,count,context)[2:])\n            np.testing.assert_allclose(actual,expected,rtol=1e-12,atol=1e-10)\n            assert actual.shape==(count,length//increment+1) and np.isfinite(actual).all() and (actual>0).all()\n            print(asset,length,count,round(time.perf_counter()-started,4),'agreement pass',flush=True)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
