{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_134","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/research.py\n@@\n-WINDOWS = {\\\"dev1\\\": (\\\"2026-07-28\\\", \\\"2026-08-07\\\"), \\\"dev2\\\": (\\\"2026-08-08\\\", \\\"2026-08-18\\\"), \\\"final\\\": (\\\"2026-08-18\\\", \\\"2026-08-28\\\")}\n+WINDOWS = {\\\"dev1\\\": (\\\"2026-07-28\\\", \\\"2026-08-07\\\"), \\\"dev2\\\": (\\\"2026-08-08\\\", \\\"2026-08-18\\\"), \\\"final\\\": (\\\"2026-08-18\\\", \\\"2026-08-28\\\"), \\\"warm_dev2\\\": (\\\"2026-07-29\\\", \\\"2026-08-18\\\")}\n@@\n     parser.add_argument(\\\"--variants-equity\\\")\n+    parser.add_argument(\\\"--variants-high\\\")\n@@\n-    tasks = [(asset, length, window, args.variants_equity.split(',') if asset in EQUITY and args.variants_equity else variants,\n+    tasks = [(asset, length, window, args.variants_high.split(',') if length==3600 and args.variants_high else args.variants_equity.split(',') if asset in EQUITY and args.variants_equity else variants,\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/rank_screen.py\n@@\n     parser.add_argument('--template')\n+    parser.add_argument('--template-window')\n+    parser.add_argument('--score-start')\n@@\n-                    source = AGENT_DIR/'results'/args.template/window/f'{asset}_{length}_smoothed.parquet'\n+                    source = AGENT_DIR/'results'/args.template/(args.template_window or window)/f'{asset}_{length}_smoothed.parquet'\n@@\n                 combined = parallel_combined(results,config,workers=args.workers)\n+                if args.score_start:\n+                    combined = combined.loc[combined.updated_at>=pd.Timestamp(args.score_start,tz='UTC')]\n@@\n     suffix = 'sampled_ranks' if not args.template else f'template_step{args.round_step}_ranks'\n+    if args.score_start:\n+        suffix += f'_from_{args.score_start}'\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+### Iteration 46 steady-state result\n+\n+The explicitly warmed production replay for August 8–18 gives Score **42.803008**. COM_EQU reward ratio is **0.0467369**, rank **161/252**, 1,469 rounds from August 8 00:36 to August 17 23:56 UTC. Crypto-hourly is **0.8953589**, rank **9/257**, 3,400 rounds from August 8 00:08 to August 17 23:57. Daily crypto is **0.3419945**, rank **63/257**, 1,043 rounds from August 8 00:48 to August 17 23:31. All use 1000 paths and the official backtester. The active miner count and effective intervals differ from short-window selection; retain the distinction. The model is commit \"'`97b60be` (subsequent experimental sampler changes are not deployed in that replay).\n+\n+### Iteration 47 dense confirmation\n+\n+Every-prompt, 1000-path CRPS confirms increment stratification daily: COM_EQU ratios 0.999876/0.999916 and crypto 0.999892/0.999880. Prefix stratification hourly gives 0.999869/0.999845 over 14,400 prompts. Confirm dev1 rewards on its existing selection interval and dev2 rewards with the explicit ten-day warmup, including an exact replay check of the warmed incumbent baseline. Do not substitute cold-window ratios for the warmed Score.\n+\n+### Recovered iteration 29 normalization result\n+\n+The archived one-variable normalization arms show COM_EQU ratios 1.000313/0.999745 and crypto 0.999966/0.999946. Equity is inconsistent and crypto gains are negligible. This resolves the old report'\"'s stale \\\"ongoing\\\" description without claiming an unperformed current-stack experiment. The actual product-of-profiles mean need not equal one.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd\nrows=[]\nfor path in Path('agent/results/incumbent_warm_dev2/dev2').glob('*_prompts.parquet'):\n    frame=pd.read_parquet(path)\n    own=frame.loc[frame.miner_uid.eq(999),['asset','time_length','start_time','crps']].copy()\n    own=own.rename(columns={'time_length':'length','start_time':'time'})\n    own['window']='warm_dev2'\n    own['variant']='incumbent'\n    own['paths']=1000\n    rows.append(own)\nresult=pd.concat(rows,ignore_index=True)\nresult.to_parquet('agent/results/warm_incumbent_scores.parquet')\nprint('Extracted warmed incumbent rows:',len(result),flush=True)\nframes=[pd.read_parquet('agent/results/'+name+'.parquet') for name in ['rank_daily_dense','rank_hourly_dense']]\ncandidate=pd.concat(frames,ignore_index=True)\ncandidate=candidate.loc[candidate.window.eq('dev1')].copy()\ncandidate['variant']='stratified'\ncandidate.to_parquet('agent/results/rank_dev1.parquet')\nPY\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=1 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run agent/research.py --name rank_warm_dev2 --windows warm_dev2 --variants stackrank:increments:1 --variants-high stackrank:prefix:1 --paths 1000 --stride-low 1 --stride-high 1 --workers 10 --resume > agent/rank_warm_dev2.log 2>&1 &\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=1 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run agent/rank_screen.py rank_dev1 --template starter_full --round-step 1 --workers 4 > agent/rank_dev1_rewards.log 2>&1 &\nwait\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
