{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_145","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"sed -n '260,310p' agent/modeling.py; sed -n '395,453p' agent/research.py; rg -n 'def replay_prompt_scores|def parallel_combined' agent/predict.py; sed -n '1,60p' agent/suggestions.md; git log -4 --oneline\"","aggregated_output":"            shocks[:,step] *= np.exp(state-spread**2)\n    elif innovation == \"boot\":\n        empirical = feature['returns']\n        sampled = rng.choice(empirical, size=shocks.shape)\n        sampled = sampled - np.mean(empirical)\n        shocks = sampled / max(np.std(empirical), 1e-9)\n    if len(parts) > 3:\n        degrees = float(shape_parameters[0]) if shape_parameters else float(parts[3])\n        if shape_parameters:\n            mean_absolute = np.sqrt(2/np.pi) if degrees >= 100 else np.exp(np.log(2)+.5*np.log(degrees-2)+math.lgamma((degrees+1)/2)-np.log(degrees-1)-.5*np.log(np.pi)-math.lgamma(degrees/2))\n            shocks *= float(shape_parameters[1]) * np.sqrt(2/np.pi) / mean_absolute\n        if 2 < degrees < 100 and atom_mode!='symboot':\n            mixing = np.sqrt((degrees - 2) / rng.chisquare(degrees, size=(count, 1)))\n            shocks *= mixing\n            if uncertainty_parameters:\n                weights = learned_weights('uncertainty')\n                head,category = int(length>3600),int(asset not in CRYPTO)\n                quantiles = weights['pooled'][head,category]\n                if uncertainty_parameters[0]=='conditional':\n                    state = np.digitize(np.log(feature['av'][60]/feature['av'][360]),[-.2,.2])\n                    quantiles = weights['conditional'][head,category,state]\n                replacement = rng.choice(quantiles,size=(count,1))\n                selected = rng.random((count,1))<float(uncertainty_parameters[1])\n                shocks *= np.where(selected,replacement,mixing)/mixing\n    if sampler:\n        from sampling import mixture_shocks\n\n        shocks = mixture_shocks(count, steps, draw_seed, sampler, sampler_degrees)\n        if sampler_persistence is not None:\n            from sampling import persistent_shocks\n\n            shocks = persistent_shocks(count, steps, draw_seed, increment, sampler_persistence)\n    if rank_mode=='increments' and rank_strength>0:\n        from sampling import stratified_marginals\n\n        shocks = (1-rank_strength)*shocks+rank_strength*stratified_marginals(shocks)\n    log_paths = np.concatenate([np.zeros((count, 1)), np.cumsum(shocks * sigma, axis=1)], axis=1)\n    if rank_mode=='prefix' and rank_strength>0:\n        from sampling import stratified_marginals\n\n        cumulative_scale = np.sqrt(np.cumsum(np.broadcast_to(sigma,(steps,))**2))\n        log_paths[:,1:] = (1-rank_strength)*log_paths[:,1:]+rank_strength*stratified_marginals(log_paths[:,1:],cumulative_scale)\n    if location_strength is not None:\n        from location import location_curve\n        from train_vol import feature_vector\n\n        log_paths += location_strength*location_curve(feature['context'],start_time,max(feature['av'][360],1e-8),\n                                                      feature_vector(feature,asset),np.arange(steps+1)*increment/60)\n    paths=feature[\"last\"] * np.exp(log_paths)\n    tick = feature['gcd_tick'] if tick_kind=='gcd' else feature['tick']\n    if atom_mode=='quantize' and 0<tick<feature['last']*.01:\n        tick *= atom_parameter\n        paths=np.maximum(tick,feature['last']+np.rint((paths-feature['last'])/tick)*tick)\n        paths[:,0]=feature['last']\n    return paths\n\n\ndef evaluate_asset(task):\n    asset, length, window, variants, count, stride = task\n64:def parallel_combined(results, competition, workers=4):\n89:def replay_prompt_scores(field, candidate):\n# Suggestions and infrastructure observations\n\n- The starter `predict.py` uses strict `MinutePriceStore.load_range`, despite campaign text describing it as a sanctioned lenient example. Read raw partitions for context so legitimate NaNs remain intact.\n- Campaign prose calls smoothing 24 hours; the pinned competition config specifies 10-day daily and 5-day hourly scoring windows. Report the implemented windows explicitly.\n- `DATA.md` says only close is populated, but inspected BTC partitions also contain real OHLCV and trade-count values. The model will depend only on close so this discrepancy cannot affect portability.\n- No operator-private research code has been encountered or used.\n- Expanded OHLC audit: the July 25 snapshot has real OHLCV/trade-count observations for all seven inspected assets, including Hyperliquid assets, generally at the same density as close. `DATA.md`'s close-only description should be corrected; it can materially misdirect model design. Models must still handle genuinely absent auxiliary fields.\n- The offline score bundle starts around July 27, 2026, rather than spanning the entire price-history window described in the campaign. Development windows were shifted accordingly.\n- A single score-only API probe explicitly requested July 1–3, 2026, to check for earlier training history. Although HTTP status was 200, response timestamps violated the requested bounds. The response was rejected before saving or analyzing any CRPS values; no dates or scores from that response were used. Do not rely on server-side historical filtering without a client-side bound check. All evaluation remains on the frozen offline bundle, and evaluators now fail closed if its environment setting is missing.\n97b60be Promote distilled daily stack and equity lead encoder; audit steady-state scoring\n416fc91 Promote confirmed temporal lead correction and investigate distilled daily scale\n45a51f0 Resume daily model research with durable scoring and temporal lead residuals\nf76e842 Promote confirmed daily temporal Sobol stack and audit refresh candidates\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
