{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_201","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+### Iteration 45 dense crypto confirmation\n+\n+Across all daily crypto development prompts, the aligned-clock control gives asset-mean CRPS ratios 0.999679/0.999825 and the shifted-clock model gives 0.999829/0.999542. Both pass two-window mean consistency, but neither dominates the other. HYPE reverses in dev1 under both fits, and BTC reverses in dev2. Replay both fixed candidates against the field before choosing or discarding them; do not cherry-pick asset branches after these results. The clock-sampling attribution remains unresolved.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=1 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run agent/rank_screen.py phase_crypto_dense --template starter_full --variants stackphase:control:1,stackphase:shifted:1 --round-step 1 --workers 3 > agent/phase_crypto_rewards.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_195","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+## Iteration 49 — smooth weekly lead shape (preregistered)\n+\n+- Hypothesis: the fitted periodic level correction depends on the prompt's clock, but not how variance evolves through the coming day. A smooth mean-preserving weekly shape may supplement the existing context-derived daily profile without assuming market closures.\n+- Change: fit a bounded +/-0.25 log-bucket correction using integrated weekly sine/cosine harmonics at frequencies 1 and 2, pooled plus asset interactions. Center its features across the five lead buckets, and preserve the current static/linear/nonlinear lead forecast's duration-weighted mean. Exclude daily harmonics because the empirical intraday clock already models that variation. Select ridge penalty 0.01/0.1/1 only on the existing pre-field chronological likelihood diagnostic; require at least 0.0001 improvement. Test only the selected full-strength correction against identity in both daily competition groups. Keep the sampler unchanged for this one-variable screen.\n+- Result: pending. No sessions, weekend gates, external calendars, new seeds, or post-cutoff data are introduced.\n+- Verdict: abandon before field scoring if the likelihood gate fails; otherwise require both-window official CRPS and reward gains per retained competition.\n+- Lesson: pending.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\napply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /workspace/agent/weekly_lead.py\n+\\\"\\\"\\\"Smooth weekly calendar features for mean-preserving lead forecasts.\\\"\\\"\\\"\n+\n+from functools import lru_cache\n+from pathlib import Path\n+\n+import numpy as np\n+import pandas as pd\n+\n+\n+def weekly_design(timestamps, assets, edges):\n+    timestamps = pd.DatetimeIndex(timestamps)\n+    phase = (timestamps.dayofweek+(timestamps.hour+timestamps.minute/60)/24)/7\n+    duration = np.diff(edges)/edges[-1]\n+    features = []\n+    for frequency in [1, 2]:\n+        angular = 2*np.pi*frequency\n+        left = angular*(np.asarray(phase)[:,None]+edges[:-1]/10080)\n+        right = angular*(np.asarray(phase)[:,None]+edges[1:]/10080)\n+        features.extend([(np.cos(left)-np.cos(right))/(right-left),\n+                         (np.sin(right)-np.sin(left))/(right-left)])\n+    harmonic = np.stack(features,axis=2)\n+    harmonic -= (harmonic*duration[None,:,None]).sum(axis=1,keepdims=True)\n+    identity = np.eye(13)[np.asarray(assets)]\n+    interactions = (harmonic[:,:,:,None]*identity[:,None,None,:]).reshape(len(timestamps),5,-1)\n+    return np.concatenate([harmonic,interactions],axis=2)\n+\n+\n+@lru_cache(maxsize=1)\n+def weekly_weights():\n+    with np.load(Path(__file__).with_name('weekly_lead_weights.npz')) as archive:\n+        return dict(archive)\n+\n+\n+def weekly_buckets(buckets, timestamp, asset_index):\n+    weights = weekly_weights()\n+    design = weekly_design([timestamp],[asset_index],weights['edges'])[0]\n+    correction = np.clip(design @ weights['coefficients'],-.25,.25)\n+    adjusted = buckets*np.exp(correction)\n+    duration = weights['duration']\n+    return adjusted*(buckets @ duration)/(adjusted @ duration)\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\napply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /workspace/agent/fit_weekly_lead.py\n+\\\"\\\"\\\"Chronological fit of a smooth weekly residual around frozen lead models.\\\"\\\"\\\"\n+\n+import json\n+\n+import numpy as np\n+import pandas as pd\n+from scipy.optimize import minimize\n+\n+from predict import AGENT_DIR, ensure_workspace_cwd\n+from temporal import temporal_embedding\n+from weekly_lead import weekly_design\n+\n+\n+def main():\n+    ensure_workspace_cwd()\n+    print((AGENT_DIR/'BUDGET.md').read_text(),flush=True)\n+    data = np.load(AGENT_DIR/'results'/'volatility_training.npz')\n+    sequences = np.load(AGENT_DIR/'results'/'temporal_exact_training.npz')\n+    leads = np.load(AGENT_DIR/'results'/'lead_training.npz')\n+    selected = sequences['indices']\n+    inputs = data['inputs'][selected]\n+    keys = pd.MultiIndex.from_arrays([data['timestamps'][selected],inputs[:,-13:].argmax(axis=1)])\n+    lead_keys = pd.MultiIndex.from_arrays([leads['timestamps'],leads['inputs'][:,-13:].argmax(axis=1)])\n+    positions = lead_keys.get_indexer(keys)\n+    valid = positions>=0\n+    inputs = inputs[valid]\n+    targets = np.clip(leads['targets'][positions[valid]],.02,20)\n+    timestamps = pd.to_datetime(data['timestamps'][selected][valid],utc=True)\n+    assets = inputs[:,-13:].argmax(axis=1)\n+    weights = dict(np.load(AGENT_DIR/'lead_weights.npz'))\n+    static = np.clip((inputs-weights['center'])/weights['spread'],-8,8)\n+    hidden = static.copy()\n+    for layer in [0,2]:\n+        hidden = hidden @ weights[f'{layer}.weight'].T+weights[f'{layer}.bias']\n+        hidden = hidden/(1+np.exp(-hidden))\n+    baseline = np.clip(hidden @ weights['4.weight'].T+weights['4.bias'],-2,2).astype(float)\n+    embedded = np.stack([temporal_embedding(sequence,values,'temporal_exact')\n+                         for sequence,values in zip(sequences['sequences'][valid],inputs)])\n+    linear = dict(np.load(AGENT_DIR/'lead_temporal_weights.npz'))\n+    linear_design = np.column_stack([embedded,static])\n+    linear_design = np.column_stack([np.ones(len(inputs)),np.clip((linear_design-linear['center'])/linear['spread'],-8,8)])\n+    duration = np.diff(weights['edges'])/weights['edges'][-1]\n+    raw = baseline+np.clip(linear_design @ linear['coefficients'],-.5,.5)\n+    baseline = raw-np.log((np.exp(raw)*duration).sum(axis=1)/(np.exp(baseline)*duration).sum(axis=1))[:,None]\n+    fine = dict(np.load(AGENT_DIR/'lead_finetune_weights.npz'))\n+    equity = assets>=5\n+    embedded_fine = np.stack([temporal_embedding(sequence,values,'lead_finetune')\n+                              for sequence,values in zip(sequences['sequences'][valid][equity],inputs[equity])])\n+    raw = baseline[equity]+np.clip(embedded_fine @ fine['head.2.weight'].T+fine['head.2.bias'],-.5,.5)\n+    baseline[equity] = raw-np.log((np.exp(raw)*duration).sum(axis=1)/(np.exp(baseline[equity])*duration).sum(axis=1))[:,None]\n+    design = weekly_design(timestamps,assets,weights['edges'])\n+    training = timestamps<pd.Timestamp('2026-07-01',tz='UTC')\n+\n+    def loss_gradient(coefficients, mask, penalty):\n+        selected_design = design[mask]\n+        raw_correction = selected_design @ coefficients\n+        correction = np.clip(raw_correction,-.25,.25)\n+        raw = baseline[mask]+correction\n+        density = np.exp(raw)*duration\n+        totals = density.sum(axis=1,keepdims=True)\n+        normalization = np.log(totals/(np.exp(baseline[mask])*duration).sum(axis=1,keepdims=True))\n+        prediction = raw-normalization\n+        scaled = targets[mask]*np.exp(-prediction)\n+        loss = ((scaled+prediction)*duration).sum(axis=1).mean()+penalty*np.sum(coefficients**2)\n+        gradient = (1-scaled)*duration/len(raw)\n+        gradient -= gradient.sum(axis=1,keepdims=True)*density/totals\n+        gradient *= np.abs(raw_correction)<.25\n+        derivative = np.einsum('nbf,nb->f',selected_design,gradient)+2*penalty*coefficients\n+        return float(loss),derivative\n+\n+    best_coefficients = np.zeros(design.shape[-1])\n+    initial = best = loss_gradient(best_coefficients,~training,0)[0]\n+    best_penalty = None\n+    diagnostics = {}\n+    for penalty in [.01,.1,1.]:\n+        fit = minimize(lambda coefficients:loss_gradient(coefficients,training,penalty),\n+                       np.zeros(design.shape[-1]),jac=True,method='L-BFGS-B',\n+                       options={'maxiter':150,'ftol':1e-10})\n+        loss = loss_gradient(fit.x,~training,0)[0]\n+        diagnostics[str(penalty)] = {'loss':loss,'success':bool(fit.success),'iterations':int(fit.nit)}\n+        print(penalty,diagnostics[str(penalty)],flush=True)\n+        if loss<best:\n+            best,best_penalty,best_coefficients = loss,penalty,fit.x\n+    np.savez(AGENT_DIR/'weekly_lead_weights.npz',coefficients=best_coefficients,\n+             edges=weights['edges'],duration=duration)\n+    metrics = {'initial_validation_loss':initial,'best_validation_loss':best,'penalty':best_penalty,\n+               'diagnostics':diagnostics,'training_rows':int(training.sum()),'validation_rows':int((~training).sum()),\n+               'target_cutoff':'2026-07-26','validation_start':'2026-07-01','passed_gate':bool(initial-best>=.0001)}\n+    (AGENT_DIR/'weekly_lead_weights.json').write_text(json.dumps(metrics,indent=2))\n+    print(metrics,flush=True)\n+\n+\n+if __name__=='__main__':\n+    main()\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nwhile kill -0 3722 2>/dev/null; do sleep 10; done\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=1 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run agent/fit_weekly_lead.py > agent/fit_weekly_lead.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
