 100 1.0390735273627907\nfast 200 1.038942660079737\n{'initial_validation_loss': 1.0427061456647972, 'selected': {'control': {'loss': 1.0393088163478683, 'stages': 200}, 'fast': {'loss': 1.038942660079737, 'stages': 200}}, 'diagnostics': {'control/50': 1.0398445191760928, 'control/100': 1.039372273076464, 'control/200': 1.0393088163478683, 'fast/50': 1.039308156238938, 'fast/100': 1.0390735273627907, 'fast/200': 1.038942660079737}, 'passed_gate': False, 'training_rows': 13080, 'validation_rows': 965, 'target_cutoff': '2026-07-26', 'validation_start': '2026-07-01'}\nNVDAX filled 132/132 price-gap prompts from validator realized paths\ndev1 NVDAX 86400: 240 prompts, 2 variants\nGOOGLX filled 220/220 price-gap prompts from validator realized paths\ndev1 GOOGLX 86400: 240 prompts, 2 variants\n   4591       00:00 /bin/bash -c cat agent/BUDGET.md; tail -8 agent/fit_fast_scale.log; tail -4 agent/weekly_lead_dense.log; ps -eo pid,etime,args | r\n   4596       00:00 rg fit_fast|while pgrep\ndev1 49.8302418279101\nwarm_dev2 45.030144456578334\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
