{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_247","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+### Iterations 49 and 52 follow-up\n+\n+Weekly-shape dense ratios are COM_EQU 0.999970/0.999884 and crypto 0.999998/0.999903. The dev1 crypto gain is negligible, so it must not be portrayed as a material success; the fixed candidate now receives full reward comparison against its original unchanged-sampler baseline.\n+\n+Fan-mean centering fails COM_EQU (1.000039/1.000047) and hourly crypto (0.999939/1.000037); reject those branches. Daily crypto passes the 0.00001 screen gate with ratios 0.999947/0.999956. Continue only daily crypto to every-prompt confirmation, including the warmed dev2 input period. No additional centering strengths are tested.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\napply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/.gitignore\n@@\n agent/results/fast_training.npz\n+agent/results/micro_score_training.npz\n+agent/results/micro_score_verification.npz\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=1 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run agent/rank_screen.py weekly_lead_dense --template starter_full --variants stackweekly:1 --round-step 1 --workers 4 > agent/weekly_lead_rewards.log 2>&1 &\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=1 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run agent/research.py --name fan_center_dense --windows dev1,warm_dev2 --format low --assets BTC,ETH,SOL,XRP,HYPE --variants stackcenter:1 --paths 1000 --stride-low 1 --workers 6 --resume > agent/fan_center_dense.log 2>&1 &\nwait\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
