{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_260","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/modeling.py\n@@\n-from scipy.special import ndtri\n+from scipy.special import logsumexp, ndtri\n@@\n     if timestamp>=WEIGHTS_AVAILABLE_FROM and hourly:\n         cumulative_scale = np.sqrt(np.cumsum(np.broadcast_to(sigma,(steps,))**2))\n         log_paths[:,1:] = _stratified_marginals(log_paths[:,1:],cumulative_scale)\n+    if timestamp>=WEIGHTS_AVAILABLE_FROM and not hourly and asset in ASSETS[:5]:\n+        log_paths -= logsumexp(log_paths,axis=0)-np.log(num_simulations)\n+        log_paths[:,0] = 0.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\napply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+### Iteration 52 promotion — daily crypto only\n+\n+Dense mean CRPS ratios are 0.999948/0.999971 against multiscale-only daily crypto. Full reward ratios improve from 0.4607167 to **0.5121465** in dev1 and from 0.3792333 to **0.3811840** in explicitly warmed dev2; ranks remain 32/257 and 61/257. Promote unconditional fan-mean centering only for daily crypto. COM_EQU and hourly keep their prior samplers without this transformation. The improvement is much larger in dev1 than in warmed dev2; do not overstate its stability or size.\n+\n+Iteration 53's score curves remain anchored to its preregistered uncentered multiscale model, not retroactively changed by this promotion. Any surviving fitted correction must later be checked in interaction with the actually deployed sampler/centering stack.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=1 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run python - <<'PY'\nimport sys,json\nimport pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\nsys.path.insert(0,'agent')\nfrom modeling import simulate\nfrom predict import load_context\nfrom research import features,generate_variant\nchecks=[]\nfor asset in ['BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE']:\n    for text in ['2026-07-28 12:19','2026-08-10 04:07','2026-08-17 09:42']:\n        stamp=pd.Timestamp(text,tz='UTC')\n        raw=load_context(asset,stamp-pd.Timedelta(days=7),stamp)\n        context=raw.loc[raw.index>stamp-pd.Timedelta(days=7)]\n        feature=features(context,stamp,300)\n        for count in [1,17,1000]:\n            actual=np.asarray(simulate(asset,np.int64(stamp.timestamp()),300,86400,count,raw)[2:])\n            expected=generate_variant(feature,asset,stamp,300,86400,count,'stackcenter:1')\n            np.testing.assert_allclose(actual,expected,rtol=1e-12,atol=0)\n            assert np.isfinite(actual).all() and (actual>0).all() and (actual[:,0]==feature['last']).all()\n            checks.append({'asset':asset,'time':str(stamp),'count':count})\nwith open('agent/results/centered_contract_audit.json','w') as output:\n    json.dump({'status':'passed','comparisons':checks},output,indent=2)\nprint('Passed 45 daily crypto serving/research comparisons with NumPy Unix-second inputs')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"Passed 45 daily crypto serving/research comparisons with NumPy Unix-second inputs\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
