{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_277","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/report.md\n@@\n # Better volatility forecasts are not the same as better miner rewards\n+\n+**Final outcome:** the frozen model scores **19.802644** on the reserved historical validation, versus **45.095169** on explicitly warmed development. It supports both required formats and passes offline/interface audits, but its development reward level does not transfer to the reserved window. No model changes follow the final result.\n@@\n-The frozen model's reserved August 18–28 scoring-time replay is running at 1000 paths, with ten prior simulation days. No final outcome is claimed yet. Model selection is closed; the final results will not be used to change serving behavior.\n+The frozen model's reserved August 18–28, 2026 scoring-time replay gives **19.802644**, using 1000 paths and ten prior simulation days:\n+\n+| Competition | Cumulative reward rank | Reward / best field reward | Reward rounds | Final-round rank |\n+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n+| COM_EQU_24H | 162 / 257 | 0.0286420 | 1,529 | 165 |\n+| CRYPTO_1H | 42 / 257 | 0.4601913 | 3,435 | 135 |\n+| CRYPTO_24H | 47 / 257 | 0.1052461 | 1,034 | 38 |\n+\n+Retained reward timestamps are August 18 00:18–August 27 23:54 UTC for COM_EQU, August 18 00:03–August 27 23:58 for hourly crypto, and August 18 00:31–August 27 23:58 for daily crypto. The machine-readable result is \"'`agent/results/frozen_final/final/competition_metrics.json`.\n+\n+This is substantially weaker than the warmed development estimate of 45.095169. Every competition'\"'s reward ratio declines. Daily crypto even improves its ordinal cumulative rank from 61 to 47 while its reward ratio falls from 0.381184 to 0.105246: ranks alone are not comparable measures of reward share across windows. The experiment does not separate development-selection optimism, market-regime changes and changes in field performance. It therefore does not establish robust transfer of the development reward level. We preserve the frozen model rather than tune or select another candidate on this result.\n@@\n Before final evaluation, all 18 active asset/format combinations pass serving/research equivalence at 17 and 1000 paths, relative tolerance 1e-12. Daily crypto additionally passes 45 comparisons across three dates and 1/17/1000 paths. Audits cover NaN-contaminated frames, missing auxiliary fields, future-row exclusion, unsorted inputs, constant/single-close contexts, zero horizon, pre-weight fallback and equivalent timestamp representations. A context without any finite positive close raises a clear error rather than inventing a starting price.\n+\n+Additional synthetic interface fixtures pass at 1/2/17/999/1000/1001 paths. Import and simulation pass with network access blocked, without importing Torch, scikit-learn or Chronos. Microsecond/nanosecond index representations agree, global RNG changes do not alter predictions, and the context-only fallback does not load fitted artifacts. The frozen source and all seven required archive hashes remain unchanged after final evaluation.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\napply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+## Final reserved validation — model unchanged\n+\n+The sole frozen-model final replay completes at 1000 paths, with August 8–18 supplying prior simulation history and reported reward rounds restricted to August 18–28 (exclusive end). The historical Score estimate is **19.802644078667015**, substantially below the warmed development estimate of 45.09516889117868.\n+\n+- COM_EQU: reward ratio **0.028641953742380485**, cumulative rank **162/257**, final-round rank 165; 1,529 rounds, August 18 00:18–August 27 23:54 UTC.\n+- Crypto hourly: ratio **0.46019129972065925**, cumulative rank **42/257**, final-round rank 135; 3,435 rounds, August 18 00:03–August 27 23:58 UTC.\n+- Crypto daily: ratio **0.10524606889697077**, cumulative rank **47/257**, final-round rank 38; 1,034 rounds, August 18 00:31–August 27 23:58 UTC.\n+\n+Verdict: nominate the model frozen at \"'`9bc60e9adff582d9d58a223ecaff6396aec23e2e`, without post-holdout parameter or candidate changes. Source and seven serving-archive hashes match the pre-evaluation manifest. Additional offline checks pass 1/2/17/999/1000/1001 paths, equivalent timestamp units, NaNs and future exclusion, deterministic RNG behavior, invalid-input errors and artifact-free pre-weight fallback. Import and serving need no network or training runtimes.\n+\n+Lesson: the much stronger development reward level does not transfer to this reserved window. The result is compatible with selection optimism and market/field changes, but does not identify their causal contributions. An improved ordinal crypto-daily rank accompanies a sharply smaller reward ratio, reinforcing the need to report both. Do not present the earlier 45.095169 development estimate as the final validation result or the future campaign Score. Unconfirmed iterations 53–54 remain excluded.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nOMP_NUM_THREADS=1 OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 uv run python - <<'\"'PY'\nimport hashlib,json,subprocess\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot=Path('agent')\nmanifest=json.loads((root/'results/final_contract_audit.json').read_text())\nassert hashlib.sha256((root/'modeling.py').read_bytes()).hexdigest()==manifest['model_sha256']\nfor filename,entry in manifest['weights'].items():\n    assert hashlib.sha256((root/filename).read_bytes()).hexdigest()==entry['sha256']\n    assert subprocess.check_output(['git','show',f'9bc60e9:agent/{filename}'])==(root/filename).read_bytes()\nassert subprocess.check_output(['git','show','9bc60e9:agent/modeling.py'])==(root/'modeling.py').read_bytes()\nmetrics=json.loads((root/'results/frozen_final/final/competition_metrics.json').read_text())\nassert len([key for key in metrics if key\"'!='\"'score_estimate'])==3\nassert len(list((root/'results/frozen_final/final').glob('*_summary.json')))==18\nexpected=100*sum(min(1,entry['reward_ratio']) for key,entry in metrics.items() if key\"'!='\"'score_estimate')/3\nassert expected==metrics['score_estimate']\nprint('Frozen source, seven committed weights, 18 backtests and final metric arithmetic verified')\nPY\ngit diff --check; git add -u; git ls-files --others --exclude-standard -z agent | xargs -0 -r git add --; git commit -m 'Publish reserved validation and honest final campaign report'; git rev-parse HEAD\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
